        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="project-item" id="pdarts-skin-transferability">
        <div class="project-label">Medical AI</div>

        <div>
          <h2>
            <a href="/projects/pdarts-skin-transferability">
              P-DARTS Architecture Transferability for Skin Lesion Diagnosis
            </a>
          </h2>

          <p>
            A controlled study of architecture-level transfer across
            dermoscopic, smartphone, and benchmark skin-lesion datasets using
            Progressive Differentiable Architecture Search.
          </p>

          <p>
            <a href="/projects/pdarts-skin-transferability">
